    "bulletList": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "1": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "bullet": "<p>HA/PLLA composite is biologically inspired and shown to be biocompatible and clinically safe with 5 years follow up.<sup>1</sup></p>\r\n",
        "textIsRich": "true"
      },
      "2": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "bullet": "<p>Ergonomic design, unique laser band and multiple options in size, needles and suture load allow surgeons ease and flexibility in repair techniques.</p>\r\n",
        "textIsRich": "true"
      },
      "3": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "bullet": "<p>More predictable resorption and remodeling of the HA/PLLA may allow for longevity of repairs.<sup>1</sup></p>\r\n",
        "textIsRich": "true"
      }
    }
  },
